ww.servicenow.com/docs/r/platform-administration/system-events/managing-system-events.html","release":"australia","product":"System Events","classification":"system-events","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":2,"breadcrumb":["System Events","Configure core features","Administer the ServiceNow AI Platform"],"tags":["#platform-administration","#system-events","#triggers","#scripts","#administration","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/platform-administration/system-events/managing-system-events.md"},
